This is a personal, non-commercial hobby project.

The project builds against and requires the BASS audio library. BASS is
proprietary software of Un4seen Developments Ltd. and is NOT licensed under
Apache-2.0 or BSD-3-Clause. No BASS files are included in this repository or in
the released binaries; BASS must be obtained separately from Un4seen
Developments (https://www.un4seen.com/). BASS is free of charge for
non-commercial use, and any commercial use requires a license purchased from
Un4seen Developments. See README.md for how to supply BASS, and
BASS-LICENSE.txt for the BASS license terms.

The released Windows binaries include libwinpthread-1.dll from the mingw-w64
project under its own MIT-style license. See NOTICE.
